    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Pilot version of Paywerk&#8217;s WooCommerce plugin&#8217;s 2nd generation.</p>\n<p>Paywerk offers Buy Now Pay Later (BNPL) payments: Pay in x parts or Pay in x days. Payments are based on debit or credit card. Order full amount will be paid to merchant after order. Overview of the transactions can be found in our Merchant Portal.</p>\n<p>Paywerk provides BNPL payments in cooperation with Swedbank. In order to enable Paywerk&#8217;s payments please contact Swedbank.</p>\n<p>Currently available only in Estonia.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>For the latest information and step-by-step guidelines visit our <a href=\"https://integration.paywerk.co/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Integration Portal</a>.</p>\n<p>In order to use Paywerk Payments plugin, you need to have a Merchant account at Paywerk. It will be created once the payment method is enabled by Swedbank.</p>\n<p>The only thing you need for configuration is API key. You can generate an API key through Merchant Portal&#8217;s menu &#8220;API keys&#8221;.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Find the plugin through WordPress&#8217;s menu Plugins, use search keyword &#8220;Paywerk&#8221;.</li>\n<li>Go to WooCommerce -&gt; Settings -&gt; Payments -&gt; Paywerk Payments. </li>\n<li>Add API key that was shown in Merchant Portal.</li>\n<li>Choose &#8220;Sandbox&#8221; mode if you want to try it out. Leave the checkbox unchecked to use the production mode. Note that you do need a separate sandbox account if you wish to do so. For that please contact merchant-support@paywerk.co.</li>\n<li>Save changes.</li>\n<li>Make sure the plugin and payment method are both activated.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><a href=\"https://integration.paywerk.co/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Integration Portal</a></p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2.0.6</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Minor design fixes</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>First public pilot version of v2.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added support for templates with block design</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Plugin released</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Extends WooCommerce by adding payment options through Paywerk.",
    "description": "<p>Pilot version of Paywerk&#8217;s WooCommerce plugin&#8217;s 2nd generation.</p>\n<p>Paywerk offers Buy Now Pay Later (BNPL) payments: Pay in x parts or Pay in x days. Payments are based on debit or credit card. Order full amount will be paid to merchant after order. Overview of the transactions can be found in our Merchant Portal.</p>\n<p>Paywerk provides BNPL payments in cooperation with Swedbank. In order to enable Paywerk&#8217;s payments please contact Swedbank.</p>\n<p>Currently available only in Estonia.</p>\n",
